      "app_name": "Play Together VNG",
      "app_id": "com.vng.playtogether",
      "text_th": "ฉันรู้ว่ามันต้องเอารหัสเข้าเกมจากเกมแรกก่อนถึงจะเข้าเล่นเกมนี้ได้แต่แฮกเกอร์เกมนี้ทำไมมันถึงเยอะกว่าเกมแรกจังเลยอ่ะพวกเขาต้องการอะไรหรือเปล่าเกมนี้ก็เป็นเกมเล่นสบายๆนะแต่ตอนนี้ไม่กล้าเล่นแล้วกลัวโดนแบน",
      "text_vn": "Tôi biết là phải lấy mã từ game đầu tiên thì mới vào chơi game này được, nhưng sao hacker ở game này lại nhiều hơn game đầu vậy? Họ muốn gì à? Game này vốn là game chơi thư giãn mà, giờ thì không dám chơi nữa vì sợ bị ban.",
      "translation_method": "ai_contextual",
      "sentiment": "Negative",
      "confidence": 0.75,
      "topic": "Social / Scam / Harassment / Toxic",
      "topic_secondary": [],
      "theme": "Tương tác xã hội tiêu cực",
      "segment": "unknown",
      "severity": null,
      "needs_review": true,
      "rating": 2,
      "intent": "complaint",
      "keywords": [
        "hack",
        "khóa tài khoản",
        "chuyển tài khoản vng"
      ],
      "summary_vn": "Hacker nhiều hơn bản cũ, người chơi sợ bị ban nên ngại chơi.",
      "label_method": "ai_review",
      "content_kind": "review",
      "activity_type": "Đánh giá store",
      "date_basis": "published_at",
      "store_sentiment": "Unhappy",
      "store_tags": [
        "Security",
        "Social And Community"
      ],
      "app_version": null,
      "text_en": "I know you need a code from the first game to play this one, but why are there more hackers in this game than the first one? What do they want? This was supposed to be a relaxing game, now I'm afraid to play because I'm scared of getting banned.",
      "summary_en": "More hackers than the old version; player is afraid to play for fear of bans."
