      "app_version": "2.30.0",
      "text_en": "Oasis sand treasure digging. I was digging sand normally and the treasure chest vanished, even though I'd almost reached it. It's happened 4-5 times, not okay at alllll. Repairing the shovel costs 4,000 stars, totally wasted and I got nothing back 😡😡",
